/P 53 0 R
/T (Practical Takeaway: This Pesach, your practical assignment is to perform a spiritual mechiras chametz \(selling of the leaven\) on your overwhelming need to be right. When a disagreement arises with your spouse regarding the holiday preparations, or when your child tests your patience precisely five minutes before Yom Tov, choose the flatness of matzah over the rising dough of your own anger. Voluntarily give up the need for the last word. By doing so, you will guarantee that the most beautiful, pristine thing sitting at your Seder table is not the imported Shmura Matzah, but the impenetrable shalom within your family.)
/E (Practical Takeaway: This Pesach, your practical assignment is to perform a spiritual mechiras chametz \(selling of the leaven\) on your overwhelming need to be right. When a disagreement arises with your spouse regarding the holiday preparations, or when your child tests your patience precisely five minutes before Yom Tov, choose the flatness of matzah over the rising dough of your own anger. Voluntarily give up the need for the last word. By doing so, you will guarantee that the most beautiful, pristine thing sitting at your Seder table is not the imported Shmura Matzah, but the impenetrable shalom within your family.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
